---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, cities } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Sellers | Diego Alvarado REALTOR®"
  description="Sell your North DFW home with clear pricing, prep that matters, and steady communication. Hablo Español."
>
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container" style="max-width:42rem;">
    <p class="eyebrow">Sellers</p>
    <h1>Sell with fewer surprises</h1>
    <p>
      Pricing, preparation, and presentation — sequenced so buyers see value without drama.
      Diego keeps sellers oriented with comparable-based pricing, prep that actually moves
      offers, and calm negotiation support through closing.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/home-value/">Get a home value consult</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;"><div class="container prose" style="max-width:42rem;">
    <h2>How Diego works with sellers</h2>
    <p>
      Listing is a project with a sequence. Diego starts with what the comps say — not wishful
      thinking — then focuses prep and presentation where buyers in your pocket actually care.
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Comparable-based pricing</strong> — recent sales, active competition, and condition, so the ask matches the market you are in.</li>
      <li><strong>Prep that moves offers</strong> — paint, repairs, and staging choices that change buyer perception, not a long vanity punch list.</li>
      <li><strong>Listing, feedback loops, and showings</strong> — clear marketing, honest feedback from tours, and adjustments when the market talks.</li>
      <li><strong>Negotiation and closing support</strong> — offers, repairs, and timeline coordination so you are not guessing mid-deal.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>What to expect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Plain-language updates on activity, feedback, and next moves</li>
      <li>Honest talk when price, condition, or timing needs a reset</li>
      <li>Coordination with photographers, title, and vendors without you chasing every detail</li>
      <li>Bilingual support when Spanish helps your household decide — see <a href="/contacto/">/contacto/</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>When to call</h2>
    <p>Reach out when you are ready to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Price a North DFW home before you list — or before you accept a private offer</li>
      <li>Decide what prep is worth doing versus what buyers will overlook</li>
      <li>Sell and buy in the same window and need the timelines to line up</li>
      <li>Talk through HOA, rental history, or condition issues that could slow a sale</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Call <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>, start at <a href="/contact/">/contact/</a>, or use <a href="/contacto/">Hablo Español → /contacto/</a>. For a focused pricing conversation,
      use <a href="/home-value/">/home-value/</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Areas Diego covers for sellers</h2>
    <p>
      Every city below is part of active listing representation — Flower Mound through the
      Grapevine Lake belt and airport-side suburbs.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="container" style="margin-top:1rem;">
    <div class="city-list">
      {cities.map((c) => <a href={`/areas/${c.slug}/`}>{c.name}</a>)}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container prose" style="max-width:42rem;margin-top:2rem;">
    <h2>Next step</h2>
    <p>
      Buying after you sell? See the <a href="/buyers/">buyer process</a>. Comparing pockets
      before you list? Browse <a href="/areas/">service areas</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Owe more than your home may sell for, or behind on payments? Read the
      <a href="/short-sale/">short sale guide</a> or the <a href="/foreclosure/">foreclosure guide</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="hero-actions" style="margin-top:1.25rem;">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/home-value/">Get a home value consult</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/contact/">Contact Diego</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/contacto/">Hablo Español</a>
    </p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
